fpdf/pdf
========

This library is a from-scratch reimagining of FPDF (http://www.fpdf.org,
author Olivier Plathey). Its high-level API and layout engine are original
work; the low-level PDF machinery — the object writer and xref/trailer
assembly, the standard-14 font metrics and font-embedding logic, the ToUnicode
CMap generation, and the JPEG/PNG/GIF/WebP image decoders — was ported from
FPDF 1.9 into typed PHP. Source-comment citations of the form `fpdf.php:NNN`
refer to line numbers in that release.

